Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Articles 6(5), 192(2) 5 and 202(1)7, a collective investment scheme registered as at the time this Act enters into force and its number of investors is one (limited to where no additional collective investment security of such collective investment scheme is issued after this Act enters into force) shall be governed by former provisions.
